   <conbody>
      <p>There are two objectives for adding filters to a section.</p>
      <ul>
         <li>To filter the data for that section.</li>
         <li>To serve as the field value when a record is added in that section.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To add a section filter, you must have an existing Section.</p>
   </conbody>
